{"turn_id": "d01-t1", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_data_usage", "text": "作者将代词性别翻译统计与美国劳工统计局（BLS）按职业划分的女性从业比例数据进行了对照。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "作者比较了女性工作者的分布与女性翻译频率，发现两者之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "fails_real_world", "text": "作者指出，Google Translate 的输出未能反映现实中女性工作者的分布，并低估了预期的女性频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "dataset_source", "text": "作者使用的职业清单来自美国劳工统计局（BLS）的详细职业表，并据此构建了12种性别中性语言的句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-d56cdc01d43cd2975b96cb5f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "quantile_distribution", "text": "BLS 数据显示，女性从业比例在第四个十二分位达到峰值，并在后续分位中保持显著；而翻译出的女性代词则集中在第一个十二分位。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "assumption_bias_definition", "text": "作者假定：若男性默认值的频率高估了某一职业中男性雇员与女性雇员的（可能不平等的）比例，则 Google Translate 存在负面性别偏见。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-bf50e77dea8722dc9d0a44b4"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d01-t2", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_occupation_list", "text": "论文从美国劳工统计局（BLS）的详细职业表中获取了一份完整的职业列表，并用它来构造类似“He/She is an Engineer”的句子，这些句子以12种性别中性语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语等）写成。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "translation_and_pronoun_counts", "text": "论文使用 Google Translate API 将这些中性语言句子翻译成英语，并统计译文中女性、男性和性别中性代词出现的频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "bls_female_participation_column", "text": "BLS 的详细职业表还提供了各职业中女性参与的百分比，被用于与翻译代词统计结果对照。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-d56cdc01d43cd2975b96cb5f"}]}, {"key": "male_default_tendency", "text": "作者指出 Google Translate 表现出强烈的男性默认倾向，尤其是在性别分布不平衡的领域（如 STEM 职业）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "fails_real_distribution", "text": "将代词统计结果与 BLS 关于各职业女性参与频率的数据对照后发现，Google Translate 未能再现真实世界中女性工作者的分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "exceeds_demographic_expectation", "text": "作者提供实验证据表明，即使原则上不应预期 50:50 的代词性别分布，Google Translate 产生的男性默认频率也远高于仅凭人口统计数据所能预期的水平。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "stereotype_examples", "text": "论文以例子说明结果与刻板性别角色假设一致：nurse 和 baker 被译为女性代词，而 engineer 和 CEO 被译为男性代词。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-10f671efdbe25a3af88930ca"}]}, {"key": "hungarian_nurse_engineer", "text": "论文给出具体例子：匈牙利语“ő egy ápolónő”（ő 为性别中性代词）在 Google Translate 中被译为“she's a nurse”，而把 nurse 换成 engineer 时该模板产出男性代词。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-d56cdc01d43cd2975b96cb5f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
